    "stem": "An 11-month old female infant exhibits severe developmental delay with associated macrocephaly, dysmorphic facies, hypotonia, and hepatosplenomegaly. Clouding of the corneas is not evident. A pebbly, ivory-colored lesion is present over the infant's back. The activity of iduronate sulfatase in the plasma is not detectable. These symptoms are indicative of which type of mucopolysaccharidosis?",
