    "id": "notion-biochemistry-0032",
    "subject": "biochemistry",
    "originalNumber": 32,
    "stem": "Patients with poorly controlled Type I diabetes exhibit elevated plasma glucose concentration. In the absence of insulin, increases result due to a lack of induction of glucokinase in which of the following organs?",
