    "stem": "A 52-year old man complains of frequent oily bowel movements. He indicates that his stools are also difficult to flush down the toilet. Previously, he had chronic pancreatitis and a high level of alcohol consumption. Which laboratory findings is MOST likely to be increased in this man?",
