    "originalNumber": 138,
    "stem": "A 10-month old infant was admitted due to vomiting and\ndecreased sensorium after her mother gave him an\norange juice. On history, he was born full term after an\nuncomplicated pregnancy, solely breastfed for the first 6\nmonths. Urine was noted to contain non-reducing\nsugars. What is the patient's most likely condition?",
