    "stem": "In gluconeogenesis, reversal of the glycolytic enzyme\npyruvate kinase involves two reactions, the second of\nwhich is catalyzed by phosphoenolpyruvate\ncarboxykinase which utilizes a source of energy from a\nsubstrate level phosphorylation such as the reaction\ncatalyzed by:",
