    "stem": "A female african-american patient presented to you with\nanemia, tissue anoxia, and painful crises, Upon doing a\nPBS, the pathologist noted several misshapen RBCs,\nforming crescent shapes. Which of the following is true\nregarding the pathophysiology of this disease?",
