    "stem": "A 45-year-old male is hospitalized for treatment of\nmyocardial infarction. His father and a paternal uncle\nalso had heart attacks at an early age. His cholesterol is\nelevated, and lipoprotein electrophoresis demonstrates\nan abnormally high ratio of low- to high-density\nlipoproteins (LDL to HDL). Which of the following is the\nmost likely explanation for this problem?",
