    "stem": "Two couples present to the ER with severe nausea,\nvomiting, and diarrhea. One of the patients admits that\nshe served salad at the dinner party to which she had\nadded a few mushrooms that she picked outside. With\nsuch information, it is likely that their symptoms are a\nresult of inhibition of what molecular event?",
    "choices": [
      {
        "label": "A",
        "text": "RNA polymerase II"
      },
      {
        "label": "B",
        "text": "RNA polymerase I"
      },
      {
        "label": "C",
        "text": "RNA splicing"
      },
      {
        "label": "D",
        "text": "RNA polymerase III"
      }
    ],
    "correctChoice": "A",
    "explanation": "a-amanitin from Amanita phylloides >> inhibits RNA\npolymerase II",
