    "id": "superexam-biochemistry-0551",
    "subject": "biochemistry",
    "originalNumber": 551,
    "stem": "A newborn presenting with vomiting and hypotonia has\nbeen found to have severe lactic acidosis. Serum analysis\nreveals elevated lactate and alanine. You are considering\na biochemical condition characterized by a deficiency in:",
