    "id": "superexam-biochemistry-0556",
    "subject": "biochemistry",
    "originalNumber": 556,
    "stem": "A 20/M comes in for knee pain and swelling. On PE, you\nnoted dark spots in his sclera. On probing, the patient\nreports that when he leaves his urine standing, it turns\nblack. You suspect an inherited condition characterized\nby a deficiency in an enzyme necessary for the\ncatabolism of this amino acid.",
