    "id": "superexam-biochemistry-0604",
    "subject": "biochemistry",
    "originalNumber": 604,
    "stem": "After a high carbohydrate meal, blood glucose level\nincreases. In the brain, how many ATPs will be\nproduced from 1 molecule of glucose after complete\noxidative glycolysis?",
