    "stem": "A woman gives birth to a full term baby. Upon delivery,\nher pediatrician, Dra. Casimiro, noticed that the baby is\nsmall and has a musty odor. Upon questioning, the\nwoman says that she did not smoke nor drink alcohol\nduring the course of her pregnancy and she only drinks\ndiet soda and water. Which of the following amino acid is\nmost likely to be deficient in the newborn?",
