    "subject": "biochemistry",
    "originalNumber": 653,
    "stem": "Glucose is the main fuel of most of the cells in the body.\nBefore it can be utilized, some cells need specific\ntransporters to mediate its use. Which among the\nfollowing glucose transporters is/are present in the\nbrain?",
